  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Used with the 100mm Y type PH2.0 to Dual SH1.0 Conversion Wire and the Power Distribution Board - 4 Channels, the brightness can be adjusted via the Potentiometer Board with SH1.0 Connector."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Ensure the COB LED Strip Light is connected to the correct power supply. Using an incorrect power supply can damage the strip."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Proper heat management is crucial. Use heat sinks or other cooling methods to prevent overheating, which can reduce brightness and cause LED failure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Ensure all electrical connections are secure and properly insulated. Regularly inspect connections to prevent short circuits or electrical shocks."
    }
  ],
