-- µڶþÌõ -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- table²¼¾Ö -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0px; font-weight: bold; height: 58.7694px;\"><!-- ±íͷ -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5898px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center; height: 19.5898px;\">LED Board Size (mm)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5898px;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"KSfLdPbP9oLIAqx2bOGcLQ9HnHg\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QIx5dSg0GoGoK2xEyfXcusbKn6c\">13.7x9.9</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"KSfLdPbP9oLIAqx2bOGcLQ9HnHg\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Carbon Steel\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6*1+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7264384073702162434\"],\"1\":[\"author\",\"7343795570639159299\"]},\"nextNum\":2}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":4230,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":12},\"recordId\":\"QIx5dSg0GoGoK2xEyfXcusbKn6c\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5898px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center; height: 19.5898px;\">Strip Light Color</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5898px;\">Yellow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5898px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center; height: 19.5898px;\">Quantity</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5898px;\">1 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table²¼¾Ö --></div>\n</div>\n<!-- ÈçÐèÌí¼ÓÔڴ˴¦Ìí¼Ó --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ÎïƷÇ嵥²¼¾ֽáÊø --><!-- ±êÌâ¼ÓÎİ¸ --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Considerations</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<ul style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-start; row-gap: 10px; column-gap: 50px;\">\n<li>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"Vkx4dDmaQozaG2xC0jucTP7pnMc\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-JJdRdHsk8ojkmaxKTAWcClVwnte\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ensure the COB LED Strip Light is connected to the correct power supply. Using an incorrect power supply can damage the strip.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"Vkx4dDmaQozaG2xC0jucTP7pnMc\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-JJdRdHsk8ojkmaxKTAWcClVwnte\">Proper heat management is crucial. Use heat sinks or other cooling methods to prevent overheating, which can reduce brightness and cause LED failure.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"Vkx4dDmaQozaG2xC0jucTP7pnMc\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-JJdRdHsk8ojkmaxKTAWcClVwnte\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ensure all electrical connections are secure and properly insulated. Regularly inspect connections to prevent short circuits or electrical shocks.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 标题加文案结束 --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "Used with the 100mm Y type PH2.0 to Dual SH1.0 Conversion Wire and the Power Distribution Board - 4 Channels, the brightness can be adjusted via the Potentiometer Board with SH1.0 Connector.\n\nEnsure the COB LED Strip Light is connected to the correct power supply. Using an incorrect power supply can damage the strip.\n\nProper heat management is crucial. Use heat sinks or other cooling methods to prevent overheating, which can reduce brightness and cause LED failure.\n\nEnsure all electrical connections are secure and properly insulated. Regularly inspect connections to prevent short circuits or electrical shocks.",
